OL,3,GNEWSACollege staff to strike over
OL,4,A'financial failings'
OL,5,
OL,6,FTeachers at a sixth form college are
OL,7,Fset to strike over "financial failings"
OL,8,Fwhich they say are threatening jobs and
OL,9,Fdamaging the education of students.
OL,11,FMembers of NASUWT will walk out of
OL,12,FPrior Pursglove College in Guisborough
OL,13,Fon Friday to begin a five-day strike.
OL,15,FThe union claimed Atomic Educational
OL,16,FTrust, which runs the college, had
OL,17,Ffailed to provide transparency or
OL,18,Freassurances about the financial
OL,19,Fposition of the college with declining
OL,20,Fstudent numbers and poor building
OL,21,Fquality.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,392,390,260,160,0,100
