OL,3,GNEWSACollege staff to strike over
OL,4,A'financial failings'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHead of Prior Pursglove College Angela
OL,7,FStevenson said the college is "open and
OL,8,Ftransparent" about changes and is
OL,9,Fcommitted to providing a high-quality
OL,10,Feducation, but recognised changes have
OL,11,Fbeen "difficult".
